{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>11月27日，據上海證券報報道，針對新作息導致員工工時增加、補貼減少等報道，海康威視回應稱相關內容不屬實，並表示反對以在崗時間替代價值貢獻。</strong>根據海康威視下發的《關於調整工作時間（試行）安排的通知》，公司將於11月30日起試行新的工作時間。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588194.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:43:57.666351+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:34:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_hash":"60fad15cb669c495a528c1c1ae4e68e3b773e82f81875e0153b9cfdb09ebabfb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}